id: pm-graph-native-analytics-help
title: Expose analytics filter flags in native pm help
description: "Follow-up from pm-graph-sdk-1122. In a non-Git tracker with the built package installed, pm --json pm-graph analyze --help succeeds with options=[], while pm --json pm-graph analyze --filter type=Task succeeds. The legacy handler publishes filter documentation in its help result. The native help renderer reads registered metadata."
